task=u1-matmul-policy-slice
base=port/pypto-x-integration @ c2ec98f3ccc8a6b8419a7a75abb2790cd62456b1

- pypto.execution: OpDefinition registry (matmul only; Core IR alias/dtype
  view derived from the existing lowering), ExecutionPolicy, capability
  snapshot, rule-based resolver (no cost model), immutable digestible
  ExecutionPlan, schema-validated ExecutionReport, portable provider binding
  and the execute_matmul / execute_matmul_plan thin entry.
- fail-closed structured errors; declaration==execution checks; deterministic
  plan digests; report is UNGATED and carries no performance claims.
- aligned with the e1cb7e6 design-freeze increment: plan/report carry
  policy_applicability and layout_decision blocks, NumericGuarantee gains
  reduction_order_id/exactness_basis, the report carries resources.parallelism
  defaults and the four non-additive coverage domains.
- focused tests: bitwise parity with the pre-U1 trunk invocation, plan
  tamper rejection, plan digest reproducibility, fail-closed policy/contract
  cases, report schema validation, Python 3.7 AST gate, registry anti-drift.
