+These tests use a synthetic ``pypto`` package namespace (like the other
+PyPTO-X unit tests) so they never trigger the upstream native initializer.
+They cover the six frozen acceptance criteria from
+``docs/20-planning/0008-...`` section 4 plus the Python 3.7 AST gate and the
+registry/core-IR anti-drift check.
